      },
      "message": "fix(app,ui): plate follow-ups - load notes, rider re-checks, square_edges\n\nDropped plate/on_plate/mod_jaw keys and dangling mounts reach the load\nnotes; LocateFixture clash-checks a plate's riders; a plate's mesh change\n(UpdateModel: re-import, RepairModel) drops its grid and unmounts riders;\nsquare_edges accepts a straight least-or-greatest edge per axis;\nMoveFixture::new uses fixture_clash::join; stud refusal prints the\nenclosing diameter; save-side warn! on vise/accessory serialise errors;\nduplicate fit-height hint removed; MoveFixture split into fixture_move.rs.\n\nFixes #826\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
