      },
      "message": "fix(app): SetPlate keeps its riders mounted\n\nSetPlate wrapped an UpdateModel whose plate branch clears the grid and\nunmounts every rider; SetPlate only restored the grid and poses, so a\npitch edit silently detached fixtures (MoveFixture carried nothing).\nUpdateModel::keeping_plate skips the plate snapshot/unmount for SetPlate,\nwhich re-seats riders itself; real mesh changes still unmount. Also\nre-indents plate_dto.rs notes.push lines.\n\nPinned by an_edited_plate_keeps_its_riders_mounted.\n\nRefs #826\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
